# Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev`. .dev.vars is gitignored; never commit real secrets.
# Nothing is required: sign-in is email + password and works without any secrets.
# Optional: Google sign-in on http://127.0.0.1:8787 (add .../api/auth/google/callback as a redirect URI).
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
